Description: WhatsApp Web for GNOME
 WhatsUp runs WhatsApp Web in a native GNOME window that stays responsive,
 follows your theme and keeps your account data private.
 .
 It embeds WhatsApp's official web client in WebKitGTK inside a GTK4 and
 libadwaita application, and adds multiple accounts, a tray icon, desktop
 notifications, downloads and editable keyboard shortcuts.
